5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Let's get this started! I'm going to find the werewolf and protect everyone, so just leave it to me!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,Such youthful energy. Let us all be patient and listen to one another with an open heart.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. I hope we can find a way to solve this peacefully and harmoniously.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll be observing. Logic and patterns are more reliable than enthusiasm.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will also observe. It is best to assess the situation before making any hasty conclusions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, you're always so cold! Why don't you try being more helpful?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Now, now, Takumi. Everyone has their own way of contributing to the village.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,Let's try to get along. Does anyone have a strategy for how we should vote tomorrow?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"We should prioritize the Seer's information, provided we can verify the Seer is genuine.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"That is the most rational approach. Until then, we have no concrete data.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I've got a plan! I'll just figure it out and tell you all who to vote for!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
