31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Listen up! I'm the Seer, and I found the werewolf already. Midori is the werewolf!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Servas,,"My goodness, so quickly? This is quite a shock to start the day.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What? Takumi, that's not true! I would never do such a thing to all of you!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"A claim on the first day is a high-risk, high-reward move. Either Takumi is the Seer or he is the werewolf.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Toshio. We must consider the possibility that the werewolf is attempting to frame a villager.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm not lying! I'm the Seer! Why would I lie when I can just win the game right now?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Midori has always seemed so kind. It is hard to believe, but the truth is often hidden.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Please, everyone, look at me! I'm just a normal villager. Takumi is just being reckless!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, if you are the Seer, your result is absolute. But if you are the werewolf, you've just outed yourself.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"The logic is simple. If we execute Midori and she is human, we lose a valuable member.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I don't care if you're scared! I'm telling you the truth! Vote for Midori!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I trust the conviction in Takumi's voice. He is young, but he is brave.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, please don't let him fool you! I'm innocent!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I find Takumi's aggression consistent with his personality, but his claim is too direct to ignore.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I am still cautious, but the probability of a villager claiming Seer this early is lower than a Seer revealing a werewolf.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,See? Everyone's starting to believe me!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us trust the Seer and save our village.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Midori,,"This is a nightmare... please, listen to me!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'm convinced. The risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf is too high.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will follow the majority. Midori it is.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
